{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MI2sjXSgDl1795666314.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人彭偉新表示，恒指到22,600點水平便有沽壓，顯示投資者對後市看法審慎，加上成交金額不足，港股投資氣氛難以改善。</p><p></p><p>獨立股評人彭偉新表示︰「我們會相信，21,800點會是一個很好的支持位，去到22,600點這個水平附近，亦都會看到沽盤隨著慢慢出現，令到大市升到這些水平卻步，顯著投資者來說對後市的看法都是較為審慎。就算近期市況急升，但成交出現3,500多億只有一次，之後都是回落，近期貼近2,000億的水平，都是預示投資者的市場的資金不足。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:21:08.284227+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T01:57:15.896350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:29.796768+00:00","content_hash":"69ffbdf7e8b42d3abdef2502a882bfdbfd87dbcc13794f1d021fcf430519c76e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:21:08.284227+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}